body:
[Corollary cor:joint-limit of arXiv:2608.26765, 'Beyond Client Averaging: A Client-Independent Second-Order Stationary-Bias Component in St'] For any sequences $\gamma_k\to0$ and integers $N_k\to\infty$, with fixed $H$ and no relative-rate condition,
\begin{equation}

  \lim_{k\to\infty}
  \frac{
    b_{\gamma_k,N_k,H}
    +\dfrac{\tau\sigma^2}{4a^2}\dfrac{\gamma_k}{N_k}
  }{\gamma_k^2}
  =-\frac{\tau\sigma^2}{12a}
  \frac{(H-1)(5H-1)}{H}.
\end{equation}

