body:
[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2609.03932, 'Khovanov monodromy groups via motions'] Let~$(C_1,d_1)$,~$(C_2,d_2)$ be chain complexes of finitely generated free~$\Z$-modules,~$f_i, g_i:C_i\rightarrow C_i$ chain maps for~$i\in\{1,2\}$ such that 
\begin{enumerate}[(i)]
    \item~$(\id \otimes \; \varepsilon_2 g_2)$ and~$(\varepsilon_1 g_1 \otimes \id)$ induce isomorphisms on the homology~$H_\ast(C_1 \otimes C_2)$; 
    \item~$(f_i)_* = \varepsilon_i (g_i)_* \colon H_*(C_i)\rightarrow H_*(C_i)$, with~$\varepsilon_i \in \{\pm 1\}$; 
    \item~$(f_1\otimes f_2)_* = \varepsilon_1\varepsilon_2 (g_1\otimes g_2)_* \colon H_*(C_1\otimes C_2) \rightarrow H_*(C_1\otimes C_2)$. 
\end{enumerate}

Then~$(f_1\otimes \id)_* = \varepsilon_1 (g_1\otimes \id)_*$ and~$(\id\otimes f_2)_* = \varepsilon_2 (\id\otimes g_2)_*$ on~$H_*(C_1\otimes C_2)$.

