body:
[Lemma lem_2 of arXiv:2412.03774, '{ Refining Concentration for \\Gaussian Quadratic Chaos with\\ Applications in Sonar and C'] Let $m\geq 1$ be an integer. For every $\frac{m+1}{m+2}< a<1$, the inequality 
 \begin{eqnarray}

-\ln(1-x)\leq x+\frac{x^2}{2}+\frac{x^3}{3}+\cdots+\frac{x^m}{m}+\frac{x^{m+1}}{(m+1)(1-ax)},\,\,\,\,\,0\leq x\leq b,
\end{eqnarray}
 holds with 
\begin{eqnarray}
b=\frac{m+1-(m+2)a}{a(m-(m+1)a)}.
\end{eqnarray}

