{"artifact_digest":"sha256:c68afaf6101d0fd731c76897b2eb4471517746f6516b1cbf2a79abc16f78f067","artifact_path":"objects/sha256/c6/c68afaf6101d0fd731c76897b2eb4471517746f6516b1cbf2a79abc16f78f067.md","bundle_digest":"sha256:b5ebb4152427e250cc5f6bdce02651902fc1e1cf5e0605680903fb7bc60f7414","bundle_entry_key":"2505-14012-theorem-18-uniqueness-of-the-invariant-me","bundle_id":"population.tex-extract-s0_084","claim_kind":"theorem","conditions":[],"domain":"probability theory","draft":"tex-extract-v2-20260907/bundle_s0_084.json","evidence_ids":[],"logical_id":"math:harvest.arxiv.mathematics:arxiv-2505-14012-theorem-18-uniqueness-of-the-invariant-me","overlay_schema_version":1,"proof_text":"Paper's own proof, opening: Let $u,z\in H$ and for any $\varphi\in\operatorname{Lip}_b(H)$ consider the difference
\begin{align*}
&\left|P_t\varphi(u)-P_t\varphi(z)\right|\\
=& \mathbb{E}\left|\varphi(u(t,v))-\varphi(u(t,z))\right|\\
\leq&  \operatorname{Lip}(\varphi)\mathbb{E}\|u(t,v)-u(t,z)\|\\
\leq& \operatorname{Lip}(\varphi)\left(\mathbb{E}\left(\|u(t,v)-u(t,z)\|^2\right)\right)^{1/2}.
\end{align*}
