[Proposition prop:cameron:martin of arXiv:2605.28106, 'Gaussian Processes with Sample Paths in Reproducing Kernel Banach Spaces'] Let \( R : X^* \to X \) be a symmetric positive operator.
    Then there exists a unique Hilbert space \( H \subseteq X \) such that
