		D(\SCL(x), \SCL(y))  = t_1 + \inf \{ t \ge 0: \SCB_t(\SCL(y)) \cap \SCB_{t_1}(\SCL(x)) \neq \emptyset\}.
	\end{equation*}
	The same identity holds if we replace one of the loops or both of them by segments. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

