[Lemma lem:CentreMacroOrder of arXiv:2511.10630, 'Cutoff for generalised Bernoulli--Laplace urn models'] For positive real number $L$, we have
    \begin{equation*}
        \pi_n(\mathrm{Meso}(L)) \geqslant 1 - dm \cdot \mathrm{e}^{-L^2/(2n)},
    \end{equation*}
    In particular, for positive numbers $C$ and $\delta \leqslant 1$, we have
    \begin{equation*}
        \pi_n({\mathrm{Centre}(C)}) \geqslant 1 - dm \cdot \mathrm{e}^{-C^2/2} \text{ and } \pi_n(\mathrm{Macro}(\delta)) \geqslant 1 - dm \cdot \mathrm{e}^{-\delta^2 n/2}.
    \end{equation*}

