body:
[Proposition prop:first-counter-example-2-general of arXiv:2604.04882, 'On a Problem of M. Kac on Laplace Distributions'] For every choice of $a>0$, $n\in\N$, and $\theta\in(0,1/2)$, the functions
    \begin{align}
        f_1(\xi)\coloneqq \left(\frac{1}{2}+\frac{1}{2\left(1+\frac{\theta a}{n}\xi^2\right)}\right)^n,
        \qquad
        f_2(\xi)\coloneqq \left(\frac{2+\frac{\theta a}{n}\xi^2}{2+2\frac{a}{n}\xi^2+\frac{\theta a^2}{n^2}\xi^4}\right)^n
    \end{align}
    are characteristic functions satisfying
    \begin{align}
        \Phi_n\bigl(f_1(\xi),f_2(\xi)\bigr)
        =
        \left(1+\frac{a\xi^2}{n}\right)^{-n}\in \cG_n,
    \end{align}
    but neither $f_1$ nor $f_2$ belongs to $\cG_n$.

