[Corollary 11 of arXiv:2607.10486, 'Weak martingale solutions to stochastic Navier-Stokes-Cahn-Hilliard system with transport '] Assume that $\phi \in \zero{H}{2}(\domO)$ and $\bu \in \StokesV$. Then
\begin{equation}
 \left(B_1(\bu, \phi), \Aone^{-1} f(\phi) \right)_{\newone{H}}
 =0,
\end{equation}
where $f(\phi)\coloneqq \psi^\prime(\phi) - \avg{\psi^\prime(\phi)}\coloneqq \psi^\prime(\phi) - \fint_{\domO} \psi^\prime(\phi(x))\,\d x$.

