[Lemma lem:rescaled-annulus of arXiv:2609.00698, 'Kinetic Wedge Layers and Diffusive Limit of Neutron Transport in Polygonal Domains'] Let $q\ge2$ be an integer and $0<\gamma<1$. There is $C=C(\omega,q,\gamma)$ such that every $v\in H^1(\mathscr A_\omega^*)$ with $-\Delta v=f$ in $\mathscr A_\omega^*$ and $v=0$ on $\partial K_\omega\cap\mathscr A_\omega^*$ satisfies
\begin{align}
 \nm v_{C^{q,\gamma}(\overline{\mathscr A_\omega})}
 &\le
 C\left(
  \nm v_{L^2(\mathscr A_\omega^*)}
  +\nm f_{C^{q-2,\gamma}(\overline{\mathscr A_\omega^*})}
 \right).

\end{align}

