[Lemma of arXiv:2506.07158, 'The diffusivity of supercritical Bernoulli percolation is infinitely differentiable'] For each $e'$ such that $\partial e' \subseteq \mathscr{C}^*_{\mathbf{a}}({\scaleobj{1}{\square}}_m)$, we have $\|D_{e'}(\nabla v_m(\mathbf{a}))\|_{\mathcal{L}_{\mathbf{a}}^2} \leqslant \mathcal{O}_s(C)$, thus
		\begin{equation}
			\sum_{\partial e' \subseteq \mathscr{C}^*_{\mathbf{a}}({\scaleobj{1}{\square}}_m)}\sum_{\partial e\subseteq \mathscr{C}^*_{\mathbf{a}}({\scaleobj{1}{\square}}_m)} |D_{e'}(\nabla v_m(\mathbf{a}))(e)|^2 \boldsymbol{1}_{\mathbf{a}(e)\not = 0} \leqslant \mathcal{O}_s(C\Big|{\scaleobj{1}{\square}}_m\Big|)
		\end{equation}

