[Lem estimation mu ki kj of arXiv:2509.15790, 'Covariance matrices of volume power functionals of random simplicial complexes -- an asymp'] The $\mu_{k_i,k_j:m+1}^{(\alpha_i,\alpha_j)}$ with $i,j \in \{m , \ldots, n\}$ from ((Eq: mu ki kj of the paper)) are bounded above by
  \begin{align} 
  \nonumber \mu_{k_i,k_j:m+1}^{(\alpha_i,\alpha_j)} &\leq (\frac{d\kappa_d}{\alpha_i+d}) ^{k_i-m} (\frac{d\kappa_d}{\alpha_i+\alpha_j+d}) ^{m} (\frac{d\kappa_d}{\alpha_j+d}) ^{k_j-m}\\
  &\leq \max_{i, j \in \{m , \ldots, n\}}(\frac{d\kappa_d}{\min\{\alpha_i,\alpha_j, \alpha_i+\alpha_j\}+d)}) ^{k_i+k_j-m}:= S_m.
  \end{align}

