{"artifact_digest":"sha256:260688f230fa887feb0c6e93016cfabbb57dd4995ae573663e818bdbf2a192de","artifact_path":"objects/sha256/26/260688f230fa887feb0c6e93016cfabbb57dd4995ae573663e818bdbf2a192de.md","bundle_digest":"sha256:b532e2bbf2b2f67db6368ab06758d6330c929232a22b31dabc29807738896d7e","bundle_entry_key":"2411-09988-theorem-12-prop-12","bundle_id":"population.tex-extract-s1_099","claim_kind":"theorem","conditions":[],"domain":"probability theory","draft":"tex-extract-v2-20260907/bundle_s1_099.json","evidence_ids":[],"logical_id":"math:harvest.arxiv.mathematics:arxiv-2411-09988-prop-12-prop-12","overlay_schema_version":1,"proof_text":"Paper's own proof, opening: Let $N$ be the number of visits to $\vec{0}$ starting at $\vec{0}$:
    \begin{equation*}
        \begin{split}
        \mathbb{E}[N] & = \mathbb{E}[\sum_{n=0}^{\infty} 1\{X_n = \vec{0}\}]\\
        & = \sum_{n=0}^{\infty} \mathbb{P}\{X_n = \vec{0}\}\\
        & = \sum_{n=0}^{\infty}\mathbb{P}\{X_{n}^{1} = 0, X_{n}^{2} = 0, \ldots, X_{n}^{d} = 0\}\\
        & = \sum_{n=0}^{\infty}\mathbb{P}\{X_{n}^{1} = 0\} \cdot \mathbb{P}\{X_{n}^{2} = 0\} \cdots \mathbb{P}\{X_{n}^{d} = 0\}\\
        & = \sum_{n=0}^{\infty} \frac{((2n)!)^d}{(n!)^{2d}}(\frac{1}{2})^{2dn}\\
        & \approx \sum_{n=0}^{\infty} \frac{1}{(\pi n)^{d/2}},
        \end{split}
    \end{equation*}
    which diverges to $\infty$ ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:dea55fd06d1843e82853b9ad9272380beedbd1c4e0516f5789d30eb3f67f7065","revision_digest":"sha256:58356ab48e9755ac33d562fd9330a63b370b3c2bfa87e90f34d836efe87df74a","source_id":"arxiv:2411.09988","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

