[Proposition prop:boundnabalvgauss of arXiv:2411.10235, '\textbf{Smooth transport map via diffusion process}'] For all $t\in [0,1)$ and $x\in \mathbb{R}^d$,  we have 
\begin{align*}
    \|\nabla V(t,x)\|\leq C t(1-t^2)^{(\beta-\lfloor \beta \rfloor)/2-1}\log\Big(\big((1-t^2)\wedge 1/2\big)^{-1}\Big)^{-\theta},
\end{align*}
which gives in particular that
    $$\int_0^1 \|\nabla V(t,\cdot)\|_{\infty}dt<\infty.$$

