[Theorem 66 (Linked-cluster theorem) of arXiv:2605.14630, '2605.14630'] The cumulant expansion of the ratio of partition functions is given by 
\begin{equation}

 \log\frac{\cZ_{1,\alpha}}{\cZ_{1,0}}
 \asymp
 \sum_{n\geqs0} \frac{(-\alpha)^n}{n!}
 \sum_{k\colon \Gamma_{n,k} \text{connected}} \Pi(\Gamma_{n,k})\;.
\end{equation}

