  $ \norm{\Gamma P_t \Phi_\ell}_{M^5\big( \Ptwo \big)}
\le C e^{-\omega t}$.
\end{enumerate}

[Proposition 1 of arXiv:2609.01850, 'A comparison theorem for relative regular holonomic $\shd$-modules'] Let $F$ be an object of $\rD^\rb_{\Rc}(\pOS)$. Then, the support of $F$ satisfies: 
\begin{equation}
\supp F=\bigcup\limits_{i\in I}X_i\times S_i
\end{equation}
for some compact subanalytic contractible subsets $X_i$ of $X$ and some closed analytic subsets $S_i$ of $S$, and, locally on $X$, the set $I$ is finite.
Moreover, the sets $S_i$ are independent of the family $(X_i)_{i\in I}$.

