[Lemma lem: CokMp_Fq of arXiv:2603.26932, 'On the satisfaction frequency of spectral characterization conditions'] Let $q = p^{\operatorname{deg}(\beta)}$. Then, for every $n\geq 1$, 
    \begin{align}
        \biggl\lvert \, \bbP\biggl(\frac{\coker(\bM_{p,\beta})}{p\coker(\bM_{p,\beta})}  \cong  \frac{\bbF_{p}[x]}{ \beta(x) \bbF_p[x]}   \biggr) -  \frac{1}{q} \prod_{i\geq 0}\Bigl(1 - \frac{1}{q^{2i+1}} \Bigr)    \, \biggr\rvert \leq \frac{3}{q^n} 
    \end{align}

