[Lemma bound_separating of arXiv:2603.05491, '\textbf{Local limits of uniform triangulations with boundaries in high genus}'] For all $n,g \ge 0$ such that $n \ge 2g-1$, we have
\begin{align*}
    \sum_{\substack{n_1 + n_2 = n \\ g_1 + g_2 = g}}
    \tau(n_1,g_1)\tau(n_2,g_2)
    \le \tau(n + 1, g).
\end{align*}

