[Theorem thm:growth of arXiv:2604.14851, 'Pool model: a mass preserving multi particle aggregation process'] \

\begin{enumerate}

\item { For $\lambda<1$, we have asymptotically a.s. $\sqrt{t}\log^{-\frac{1+\epsilon}{2}}(t)\le {\mathcal{E}}_t\le \sqrt{t}\log(t)$ for all $\epsilon>0$. }
