which is detailed balance. When detailed balance holds, its entries satisfy

\[
(D^{-1}P^{T}D)_{ij}
=\sqrt{\frac{\nu_j}{\nu_i}}\,P_{ji}
=\sqrt{\frac{\nu_i}{\nu_j}}\,P_{ij}
=A_{ij},
\]

which gives (equation eq:A-two-forms of the","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:d9fc4246fa5eb2addc313034c57b6dc9f2b51671dbcdb6df5fd3d974caa130d1","revision_digest":"sha256:6aa4dc8a6d3caf009800a88ebc27acfc548112fdb0447b7439b6ba54f2bde132","source_id":"arxiv:2608.01253","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

