			\sup_{N \in \mathbb{N}}\Big \| \left\|\rho^N \right\|_{L^2H_2^1} \Big \|_m  & < \infty.  \end{align*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

[Theorem 22 (Extremum Principle for rough functions) of arXiv:2606.07290, 'Boundary behaviour of the Volterra square-root process'] Let $f \in S_{L, \gamma}$. If $f(t) \geq 0$ for all $t \in (0, t_*]$ and $f(t_*) = 0$ for some $t_* \in (0, T)$, then
\begin{equation}
    (D_L f)(t_*) \le 0.
\end{equation}

