	\end{equation}
	For convenience, throughout, we denote $\coefficientsInVectorfieldsTangetToUbarDataSurface_A \eqdef \frac{\geop{x^A} \muX \upmu}{\muX \muX \upmu}$ as the coefficient of $\muX$ in \eqref{E:ANGULARVECTORFIELDTANGETTOUBARDATASURFACE}. That is, $\datasurfacegeometricp{x^A} = \Lunit - \coefficientsInVectorfieldsTangetToUbarDataSurface_A \muX$.  
