[Cor smash-gl-left-Quillen of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] The smash product defines a left Quillen bifunctor 
    \begin{equation}
        \cat{$\bm{G}$-OrthSp}\times\cat{$\bm{G}$-OrthSp}\to\cat{$\bm{G}$-OrthSp}
    \end{equation} 
    with respect to the $G$-global model structures for any compact Lie group $G$.
    \begin{proof}
        We may factor $((eq:smash-product-G-gl of the paper))$ as
        \[
            \cat{$\bm{G}$-OrthSp}\times\cat{$\bm{G}$-OrthSp}\xrightarrow{\;{-}\smashp{-}\;}\cat{$\bm{(G\times G)}$-OrthSp}\xrightarrow{\;\Delta^*\;}\cat{$\bm{G}$-OrthSp}.
        \]
        The claim now follows from the previous proposition together with Lemma~(lemma:restr-inj-gl-sp-left-Quillen of the paper).
    \end{proof} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

