[Lem scm:mb of arXiv:2411.11759, 'Milstein-type schemes for McKean--Vlasov SDEs driven by Brownian motion and Poisson random'] If Assumptions  \mbox{\normalfont  (asum:ic of the paper)} and \mbox{\normalfont  (asump:super of the paper)} to \mbox{\normalfont  (asump:sig:gam:tame of the paper)}  are satisfied, then the following holds
		\begin{align*}
			\sup_{i\in\{1,\ldots,N\}}\sup_{ t\in[0,T]}E|x_t^{i,N,n}|^{\bar p}\leq K
		\end{align*}
		where $K>0$ is a constant independent of $N$ and $n$.

