[Lem 19 of arXiv:2609.03777, '2609.03777'] Let $\nu\in\ZZ_{>0}\cup\{\infty\}$ and $r\geq0$. For $\tau\in C$ and lattice points $\mu_1,\mu_2\in\Lambda_\tau$ with $\mu_1\succ_\nu\mu_2$, we have
\begin{align}
\left|G^{(\nu;\mu_1,\mu_2)}_{\{2\}^r}(\tau)\right|&\ll_{C,r}\LL(|\mu_1|+|\mu_2|)^r\,.
\end{align}

