Using that $|f(v)| \leq \|f\|_{\Hol\gamma}(v-s)^\gamma$ (because $f(s) = 0$),
\begin{equation}
\| f \|_{L^2[s,t]}^2 = \DOTSI\upintop\ilimits@_s^t |f(v)|^2 \,\mathrm{d} v \leq \| f \|_{\Hol\gamma}^2 \DOTSI\upintop\ilimits@_s^t (v-s)^{2\gamma} \,\mathrm{d} v \lesssim_\gamma \| f \|_{\Hol\gamma}^2 (t-s)^{2\gamma + 1},
\end{equation}
and $2\gamma + 1 = 2(\gamma + H)$ for $H = \frac 12$. Assume now $H < \frac 12$.
Applying (lem:characterization of the paper),
