Together with Assumption~\ref{ass:rccbm-conditional-kernel}, the envelope condition also yields \(\bm u^{\beta,\varepsilon}\to\bm u^\beta\) locally on every strip \([0,T-\tau]\) and in the corresponding uniformly integrable \(L^2\) topology. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

