body:
[Lemma lem:radius-lognormal of arXiv:2608.18293, 'Critical tensor covariance at the Marchenko--Pastur threshold'] Under (equation eq:critical-scaling of the paper),
\begin{equation}
  \log P_n\Rightarrow
  N\!\left(-\frac{\lambda v}{2},\lambda v\right),

\end{equation}
and
\begin{equation}
  R_n\Rightarrow
  R=\exp\!\left(\sqrt{\lambda v}\,Z-\frac{\lambda v}{2}\right).

\end{equation}
In fact $R_n/P_n\to1$ in probability. Moreover,
\begin{equation}
  \operatorname{Law}(R_n)\longrightarrow\operatorname{Law}(R)
  \quad\text{in }W_2,
  \qquad
  \mathbb{E} R_n^2\longrightarrow e^{\lambda v}.

\end{equation}

